                "entry_id": "248d4a4c-26a5-3a93-bd2f-52f0aaa2afe3",
                "word": "Polonese",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b7c06f90-fd5e-3b35-a57b-c268b5b57fa2",
                        "entry_id": "248d4a4c-26a5-3a93-bd2f-52f0aaa2afe3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Polish."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable",
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3a7888e6-5f9a-4b89-b25b-828ea014f07b",
                                "sense_id": "b7c06f90-fd5e-3b35-a57b-c268b5b57fa2",
                                "text": "Warſaw, March 26. An expreſs is arrived with advice, that the reconfederates of Podolia had formed a ſcheme to carry off the commander of the troops belonging to the Republick; but the latter having been informed of it, had retired into the fortreſs of Kaminieck, which he was obliged to do with ſo much precipitation, that all the Poloneſe companies, conſiſting of two thouſand men, were made priſoners."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e940473-dcde-4e0b-a0b8-0f3a56e13cc8",
                                "sense_id": "b7c06f90-fd5e-3b35-a57b-c268b5b57fa2",
                                "text": "To keep up appearances, however, he succeeded in obtaining declaration at the diet held at Warsaw, that such of the Polonese nobility alone as were born of catholic parents could pretend to the crown; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b6f98c7d-f8a0-484a-b3ec-151937385713",
                                "sense_id": "b7c06f90-fd5e-3b35-a57b-c268b5b57fa2",
                                "text": "You have seen announced in several of our papers an intention of the Polonese nation to erect a monument near Cracow to the memory of General Kosciusko, and their wish that England and the United States, by joining in contributions, might give a proof of the interest they take in his character; […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
